      "text": "Production adoption, human review, physical-phone evidence, and independent Step 2 remain open outcomes; they are separate from the completed Simulator implementation and downloads. | When: 2026-11-15 | The project explicitly requires these outcomes to remain unresolved rather than treating them as completed or as evidence that Step 1 is unfinished.",
