    {
      "id": "e635b7f4-7265-4ad6-9ede-90179f99d6e3",
      "text": "For on-device local AI evaluation, Simulator was selected for the current stage. Step 1 completed actual SDK/model checks and repeated Simulator comparisons covering 450 completed operations plus 15 explicit MLX-unavailable cases, with separate real-Mac MLX execution; however, quality failures keep production adoption open, and physical battery/heat evaluation remains future phone-readiness work. | When: November 14, 2026 | The measured results do not yet justify production component adoption or close the broader outcome boxes.",
